        "id": 1318371
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-13T02:20:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The 1.0 is only for A2DP offloading (BluetoothA2dp) and the new HAL is unified for BT streaming like Hearing Aid / A2DP. We also add more codec specified to more completed the interface.",
      "parentUuid": "1e7bafe8_ca36c1e0",
      "revId": "0bbb1feb164c17aa8175a025baf7731a7cf8fcec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a304ae34_b8f1c6cd",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/2.0/IBluetoothAudioPort.hal",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 19,
